Wed Nov  4 06:32:01 UTC 2026 - Mia Herkt <mia@0x0.st>

- Update to 0.36.0:
Breaking
  * Drops support for Python v3.9 and v3.10.
    Python v3.11 or newer is required.
    gh#python-validators/validators#488
  * Stricter validation: the following inputs, previously accepted
    by mistake, are now rejected.
    + isin() now verifies the check digit, which was previously
      ignored. Lowercase ISINs are still accepted.
      gh#python-validators/validators#464
    + cusip() and sedol() require a numeric check digit.
      gh#python-validators/validators#487
    + md5(), sha1(), sha224(), sha256(), sha384(), sha512(),
      base16(), base32(), base58() and base64() reject trailing
      characters, such as a trailing newline.
      gh#python-validators/validators#486
    + ind_pan() requires a full-string match.
      gh#python-validators/validators#478
    + fr_ssn() no longer accepts a comma as the gender or Corsica
      department character.
      gh#python-validators/validators#469
    + domain() rejects an underscore in the last label and names
      longer than 253 octets once IDNA-encoded, as defined by
      RFC 1035.
      gh#python-validators/validators#485
      gh#python-validators/validators#461
    + mastercard() accepts only the 2221-2720 range of the
      2-series BINs.
      gh#python-validators/validators#467
    + eth_address() rejects non-hexadecimal characters.
      gh#python-validators/validators#466
    + mac_address() rejects mixed separators.
      gh#python-validators/validators#432
    + slug() rejects a trailing newline, and telnet URIs reject
      control characters.
      gh#python-validators/validators#492
Features
  * feat(uri): add telnet URI validation per RFC 4248
    gh#python-validators/validators#446
  * Accept file:// URLs per RFC 8089
    gh#python-validators/validators#483
  * cron: accept a step over a range (e.g. 1-5/2) and in list items
    gh#python-validators/validators#482
  * Accept lowercase IBANs in iban()
    gh#python-validators/validators#471
  * fix(cron): accept day-of-week 7 as a Sunday alias
    gh#python-validators/validators#470
  * Accept a trailing dot on simple hostnames with rfc_1034
    gh#python-validators/validators#462
  * fix(crypto_addresses): accept testnet (tb) segwit addresses
    gh#python-validators/validators#466
Maintenance
  * fix: reject MAC addresses with mixed separators
    gh#python-validators/validators#432
  * feat: Optimize slug. Extend tests.
    gh#python-validators/validators#439
  * chore: update codebase to reflect new username
    gh#python-validators/validators#447
  * docs: correct PossibleValueTypes note in between to include
    None
    gh#python-validators/validators#460
  * chore: use native pyproject config for tox and pytest
    gh#python-validators/validators#490
  * test: cover RFC length limits for domain() and hostname()
    gh#python-validators/validators#493
  * chore!: adopt uv and PEP 735 dependency groups
    gh#python-validators/validators#495
  * docs: explain why the documentation is hosted on the
    maintainer's fork
    gh#python-validators/validators#497
  * docs: hide badges from the man page; upgrade docs tooling to
    latest stable
    gh#python-validators/validators#498

